  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two long, parallel vertical wires, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, are separated by a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span> and carry currents of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3I\"></span> respectively in opposite directions as shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The magnetic force exerted by wire <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> on wire <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> to the right. What is the magnetic force exerted by wire <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> on wire <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> to the left</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> to the right</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3F\"></span> to the left</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3F\"></span> to the right</p></li></ol>"
  },
